WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240
We met the country bumpkin brought back by the Su family

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:03,680
Brother Yan just went after him

3
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:04,880
He must have done something

4
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:06,380
What country bumpkin?

5
00:00:06,780 --> 00:00:07,820
I don't know him at all

6
00:00:09,030 --> 00:00:11,830
Wen Chen is at Zhongzhou University

7
00:00:12,230 --> 00:00:13,830
Wen Chen is my cousin

8
00:00:14,030 --> 00:00:15,510
I don’t know how he got in.

9
00:00:15,710 --> 00:00:16,830
Why is everyone leaving the door open?

10
00:00:17,270 --> 00:00:19,710
Maybe he was just going to meet friends

11
00:00:19,950 --> 00:00:20,910
Where did he go after that?

12
00:00:21,070 --> 00:00:22,980
Are you still in school? No?

13
00:00:23,060 --> 00:00:24,940
This matter must have something to do with Wen Chen

14
00:00:25,420 --> 00:00:26,540
He just came to Zhongzhou

15
00:00:26,660 --> 00:00:27,740
How could it harm Yan?

16
00:00:28,180 --> 00:00:29,380
Who are you talking about?

17
00:00:29,380 --> 00:00:30,620
I don't know him

18
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:32,920
Just a little girl

19
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:34,320
It's time for Xiaoyan to rest

20
00:00:34,480 --> 00:00:36,200
The Su family doesn't pay attention to this real signing money

21
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:38,970
Things will be easier to handle. Go check on Wen Chen.

22
00:00:39,090 --> 00:00:40,450
Find it and take it to a villa in the countryside

23
00:00:40,730 --> 00:00:42,050
Wen Chen is at Zhongzhou University

24
00:00:43,540 --> 00:00:46,100
I want to confirm Wen Chen’s contact information and address. Sorry.

25
00:00:46,180 --> 00:00:47,900
We cannot disclose students' private information

26
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:49,740
Wen Chen is a freshman majoring in weapons.

27
00:00:49,820 --> 00:00:51,260
If you have anything to do, please come to school and tell me in person.
